      "order": 6,
      "speaker": "PRYCE",
      "qualifier": null,
      "context": null,
      "script_text": "Before the order! (points at the TV) You know what they're saying on the news? Everybody you look at ends up dead. Everybody. The killer's got somebody inside. It's in the papers, man.",
      "text": "Before the order! You know what they're saying on the news? Everybody you look at ends up dead. Everybody. The killer's got somebody inside. It's in the papers, man.",
